{"skill":{"slug":"session-logs","displayName":"Session-logs"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770136427000,"changelog":"Initial release of session-logs.\n\n- Enables searching and analyzing your session logs (past conversations) with jq and ripgrep (rg).\n- Provides bash command examples for session discovery, keyword searches, extracting messages, cost summaries, and tool usage breakdowns.\n- Documents JSONL session file structure, roles, and content types.\n- Lists session log file locations and naming conventions.\n- Includes tips for managing and querying large, append-only session histories.","changelogSource":"auto","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":3409,"sha256":"f87582f99fee9009249bd66cedd6d227303b6fbe25ac55a0cb756c81eb808187","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1606,"sha256":"1567967999376f57816106c32ee3eef2b96a174954f4a64805e50c6060ba2d0d","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789031186620,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"c7306b8116f5c5d174f09bacc3af58d911015423657de108b8928c774f4d48a0","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/c7306b8116f5c5d174f09bacc3af58d911015423657de108b8928c774f4d48a0","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: session-logs\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill is designed to search and analyze the agent's own session logs using standard Unix utilities like `jq` and `rg`. All shell commands provided in `SKILL.md` operate exclusively on files within the agent's internal log directory (`~/.clawdbot/agents/<agentId>/sessions/`) and are directly relevant to the stated purpose. There is no evidence of data exfiltration, malicious execution, persistence, or prompt injection with harmful intent. The instructions guide the agent to perform its intended function of log analysis.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779161134281},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":9,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":1,"checkedAt":1789031186620},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill openly helps search local conversation history, but it is broad enough to expose unrelated private session logs without clear consent or minimization guidance.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Reading all logs under ~/.clawdbot/agents/<agentId>/sessions/ is sensitive local data access and may include unrelated sessions, tool results, costs, provider mappings, or deleted-session remnants.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The artifact is a single Markdown skill with metadata requiring jq and rg; it includes no bundled executable scripts, package installs, remote payloads, or install-time mutation.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The instructions include searching complete conversation history and all session JSONL files, but do not require narrowing to a specific authorized session, minimizing excerpts, or redacting sensitive content before display.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"No persistence mechanism, privilege escalation, background worker, credential store access, or file modification behavior was found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The capability matches the stated purpose of finding older or parent conversations in local JSONL session logs, and no unrelated network, execution, or destructive behavior is present.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Install only if you want agents to inspect local saved conversation logs. Before using it, specify the exact session, date, or phrase you authorize, and avoid broad all-session searches when logs may contain secrets, private messages, tool outputs, or content from other contexts.","findings":"[SQP-2] expected: The scanner concern is supported in part: historical session access is central to the skill and disclosed, but the artifact lacks consent, scoping, and redaction guidance for sensitive prior conversations.\n[T05] expected: The static finding is materially supported by the all-session search examples. This is not privilege escalation or exfiltration, but it is broad local transcript access with weak boundaries.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789031186620}}}}}